# Appended to a Claude reviewer's task: Claude Code's bundled `/code-review` skill is the core of its review
# (design §10). Always name the level (it otherwise reuses the user's last one) and the target (it otherwise
# reviews the worktree's own branch). The level follows the review's size (`review.level.<size>`): higher levels mostly
